4. DIAGRAMAS GENERADOS (FORMATO TEXTUAL)\par 
============================================================\par 
4.1 Diagrama de contexto (C4-Context simplificado)\par 
\par 
[Estudiante] ----> |\par 
[Profesor]   ----> | Frontend Next.js (roles, UI, chat)\par 
[Admin]      ----> |\par 
                     |\par 
                     v\par 
                Backend Spring Boot API\par 
                     |\par 
         +-----------+-----------+\par 
         |                       |\par 
         v                       v\par 
   PostgreSQL                APIs externas\par 
 (usuarios, casos,          (PubMed, Europe PMC,\par 
  busquedas, logs)           ClinicalTrials)\par 
\par 
4.2 Diagrama de casos de uso (resumen)\par 
- Actor Estudiante:\par 
  Buscar evidencia, Verificar claim/URL, Generar bibliografia, Resolver casos, Chatear.\par 
- Actor Profesor:\par 
  Gestionar casos, Evaluar entregas, Gestionar hedges, Ver analiticas, Buscar, Chatear.\par 
- Actor Administrador:\par 
  Gestionar usuarios, Auditar, Configurar sistema, Monitorear salud/APIs, Mantenimiento, Chatear.\par 
\par 
4.3 Diagrama de componentes (alto nivel)\par 
\par 
Frontend\par 
- app/student/*\par 
- app/professor/*\par 
- app/admin/*\par 
- components/*\par 
- hooks/*\par 
- contexts/auth-context\par 
\par 
Backend API\par 
- Auth + Security JWT\par 
- Search/Verification/Bibliography\par 
- Cases/Evaluations\par 
- Admin/Audit/System/Health\par 
- Chat REST + WebSocket\par 
\par 
Integraciones\par 
- PubMed\par 
- Europe PMC\par 
- ClinicalTrials.gov\par 
\par 
Persistencia\par 
- users, competency_progress\par 
- search_sessions, search_results\par 
- verification_results\par 
- case_studies, case_submissions\par 
- system_logs, chat_messages\par 
\par 
4.4 Diagrama de secuencia: busqueda avanzada estudiante\par 
\par 
Estudiante -> Frontend: Define query + filtros\par 
Frontend -> /api/search/execute: POST SearchRequest\par 
Backend -> Proveedor externo(s): Consultar evidencia\par 
Proveedor externo(s) -> Backend: Resultados\par 
Backend -> DB: Guardar search_session + resultados\par 
Backend -> Frontend: SearchResponse\par 
Frontend -> Estudiante: Mostrar resultados + opcion guardar\par 
\par 
4.5 Diagrama de secuencia: monitor de APIs externas (admin)\par 
\par 
Admin -> Frontend Admin: Ejecutar diagnostico\par 
Frontend -> /api/admin/external-apis/check: POST query\par 
Backend -> PubMed: test query\par 
Backend -> Europe PMC: test query\par 
Backend -> ClinicalTrials: test query\par 
Backend -> Frontend: estado por proveedor + latencia + cobertura\par 
Frontend -> Admin: tablero de diagnostico\par 
\par 
4.6 Diagrama entidad-relacion (conceptual)\par 
\par 
users (1) ---- (0..1) students\par 
users (1) ---- (0..1) professors\par 
users (1) ---- (0..1) administrators\par 
\par 
users (1) ---- (N) search_sessions ---- (N) search_results\par 
users (1) ---- (N) verification_results\par 
\par 
professors (1) ---- (N) case_studies ---- (N) case_submissions ---- (N) students\par 
case_studies (1) ---- (N) case_guiding_questions\par 
\par 
users (1) ---- (N) system_logs\par 
users (1) ---- (N) chat_messages (como sender/recipient)\par 
\par 
4.7 Diagrama de despliegue (logico)\par 
\par 
[Navegador]\par 
   |\par 
   v\par 
[Next.js App (Puerto 3000)]\par 
   |\par 
   v\par 
[Spring Boot API (Puerto 8080)] ---- [WebSocket endpoint]\par 
